000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   T Z E R O B U F F                                *
001200*                                                    *
001300*   THIS PROGRAM WILL CHECK TO MAKE SURE ALL NUMERIC *
001400*   DEFINED FIELDS ARE NUMERIC. IF A FIELD IS FOUND  *
001500*   NOT TO BE NUMERIC THEN ZEROS IS MOVED IN.        *
001600******************************************************
      *C
      *C  09/03/1996   CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  10/27/1997        CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED PROGRAM TO PICK UP NOTIFY USER-ID IN DSHIPREL.

001700
002300
