       FD  PRINT-FILE
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-REC.
       01  PRINT-REC                PIC X(132).

003500 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".
003600
       01  ERROR-RECORD-CTR             PIC 9(8) VALUE ZERO.
       01  ERR-SW                       PIC X  VALUE SPACES.

